   "updated_at": "2026-11-17T20:59:43Z",
   "body": "**Operator decision, 2026-11-17 22:10 Paris: an info bubble, not a description under the picker.** This replaces scope item 1.\n\n- Next to the « Bouton + » picker, an `info.circle` button opens a **popover** (`.popover`, with `presentationCompactAdaptation(.popover)` so it stays a bubble on iPhone) that lists **the three choices** with one sentence each. The default is marked.\n- The text follows the **verified** behaviour (scope item 2 still applies: the code wins over the doc comment, quotes in quick reply included).\n- Accessibility: the button's label is « À propos du bouton + », and the popover is read in full.\n- Acceptance: a test that the three descriptions exist and are non-empty, plus a test that the info button is present. The quick-reply quote merge test is unchanged.\n\nThis departs from decision F (#1014), which put a description under a switch, for this row only (operator).\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
